# Keeps this directory in version control.
#
# `html_static_path = ['_static']` in conf.py points here. Git does not track
# empty directories, so without this file a fresh clone (as Read the Docs
# makes) has no `_static/` and Sphinx warns -- which fails the build, because
# `.readthedocs.yaml` sets `fail_on_warning: true`.
#
# Put custom CSS, a logo, or other static assets here.
